STEP 2: KPI DEFINITIONS
-------------------------------------

Implement KPIs:

1. Non-Urgent ED Visit Rate
= Non-urgent ED visits / Total ED visits

2. Avoidable ED Cost
= Sum of cost for non-urgent ED visits

3. ED Utilization Rate
= (Total ED visits / Total members) * 1000

4. Frequent ED Utilizer Rate
= Members with >=3 ED visits / Total members

